OL,3,GNEWSAStormont MLAs to receive more than
OL,4,A#1k pay rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt has been confirmed that Northern
OL,7,FIreland Assembly members (MLAs) will
OL,8,Fsee their salaries rise by just over
OL,9,F#1,300 from next May.
OL,11,FStormont's Independent Remuneration
OL,12,FBoard had initially proposed increasing
OL,13,FMLAs annual salary to #69,216.
OL,15,FBut on Thursday the board said having
OL,16,Ftaken hundreds of views on board in a
OL,17,Fpublic consultation, it would now limit
OL,18,Fthe increase to 2% instead of 3%.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
