OL,3,GNEWSAStormont MLAs to receive more than
OL,4,A#1k pay rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FChair of the board, Alan Lowry, said a
OL,7,Freduced cap on the annual percentage
OL,8,Fincrease will be put in place after
OL,9,Fthat date, limiting the overall
OL,10,Ffinancial impact of the changes.
